# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No environment variables are required.
#
# This site is a static build (next.config.ts sets output: "export"), so there
# is no server and no API key anywhere in the project. The Request Security
# form writes the enquiry into a message addressed to
# contact@bsmsecurityagency.com and hands it to the visitor's own Gmail or
# mail app; they press Send, so nothing is ever reported as delivered when it
# has not been.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
